{"title":"Lizper Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 52)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 52 <span class=\"muted\">(5611 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\">Lizper Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/dd129647f99f5468086c.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c3eecca19eb984f3f455.svg\" alt=\"\">Lizper Scale</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/639e656beda54ecb8321.svg\" alt=\"Lizper Legs\"></div><h3>Lizper Legs</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 52</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}